  "_comment_chatter": "Greetings, acknowledgements and hesitation. A fragment made only of these was not addressed to the shop, so it is discarded instead of raising a card asking whether to add it to the price list. Not `fillers`: fillers are stripped out of a sentence that IS an order, these decide it never was one.",
